<% content_for :title, "BonID Verification Submitted" %>

<h2><i class="ri-mail-check-line icon" style="color: var(--palm-green);"></i>Verification Submitted</h2>

<div class="status-card">
  <strong>Status:</strong> Pending Review<br>
  Your submission is currently being reviewed by our verification team.
</div>

<p>Dear <strong><%= @submission.user.first_name %></strong>,</p>

<p>
  Thank you for submitting your identity verification request. Our reviewers are
  currently validating your documents to confirm your BonID.
</p>

<p>
  You can check your submission progress anytime on your dashboard:
</p>

<p>
  <a href="<%= citizens_identity_submissions_url %>" class="button">View My Submission</a>
</p>

<p>
  Once approved, you’ll receive your digital BonID QR code, which you can share with
  verified authorities such as banks, embassies, and police officers.
</p>

<p>Warm regards,<br>
The BonID Verification Team 🇭🇹</p>
